WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Members and roles. See who's in a workspace, change their role, or remove them.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: client visibility; handing over.

3
00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:11.510
(Note: Milo and Edie joined through invites before the recording.) Members lists everyone in the workspace with their role.

4
00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:13.100
Change a role from its dropdown — here Milo becomes a Viewer.

5
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:17.730
Remove takes someone out of the workspace at once.

6
00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:23.730
There's no Role dropdown on a row: You need Admin or Owner, and the creator's row is locked. A removed person still sees the workspace: Their next request is refused; ask them to reload.

7
00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:28.230
Four roles enforced on every API call
